# Knight of Autumn: "choose one" (CR 700.2): exactly one mode, so choosing the counters and the life together is
# refused. With no artifact or enchantment on the battlefield the "destroy target artifact or enchantment" mode has no
# legal target and is not offered (CR 700.2b), so it is refused too. The third mode, "You gain 4 life", is the one
# chosen: Bot1 is at 24 and the Knight stays a 2/1. Bot1 pays with Plains, Forest and a Plains that are not artifacts.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Forest
Plains
Knight of Autumn
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
