Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Knight of Autumn.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Modes(Destroy target artifact)
! Bot1.Modes(1; 3)
Bot1.Modes(You gain 4 life)

